    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000st48](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000st48) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 72.266 depth occurred on Jun 15 2026 19km SE of Glan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.658 longitude 125.2618. It impacted 446636 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
